, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "compositions", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射"}, {"source_term": "Stacks", "target_term": "叠"}, {"source_term": "residual gerbe", "target_term": "剩余簇胚"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "Stacks", "target_term": "叠"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图式"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表现"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "fppf covering", "target_term": "fppf 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "nonempty", "target_term": "非空"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "（本段中出现的所有态射（morphisms）均可表示（representable）为代数空间（algebraic spaces），因而《叠（Stacks）的性质》第<REF_0001>节中的约定和结果均适用。）\n假设<MATH_0001>是一个有限型点（finite type point）。选取一个仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0002>、一个闭点（closed point）<MATH_0003>以及一个光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，使得<MATH_0005>，见引理<REF_0002>。\n照例令<MATH_0006>。令<MATH_0007>，从而得到一个代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的群胚（groupoid）<MATH_0008>，见《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0003>。\n投影（projection）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0009>是复合（compositions）<MATH_0010>，其中第一个箭头是有限型（finite type）的（它是概形（schemes）的闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0011>的基变换（base change）），第二个箭头是光滑（smooth）的（它是光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>的基变换（base change））。因此，<MATH_0013>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的（因为它们是复合（compositions），见《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0004>）。\n由于<MATH_0014>是一个域（field）的谱（spectrum），可知<MATH_0015>是平坦（flat）且局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）的（由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0005>）。\n可知<MATH_0016>是一个代数叠（algebraic stack），依据为《可表示性判别准则》定理<REF_0006>。\n由《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0007>，我们得到一个典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0017>，它是全忠实（fully faithful）的。因此，这个态射（morphism）可表示（representable）为代数空间（algebraic spaces），见《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0008>，并且是一个单态射（monomorphism），见《叠（Stacks）的性质》引理<REF_0009>。\n由此可知，<MATH_0018>这一<MATH_0019>在<MATH_0020>处的剩余簇胚（residual gerbe）存在，且<MATH_0021>经由一个等价（equivalence）<MATH_0022>分解，见《叠（Stacks）的性质》引理<REF_0010>。\n由构造，图式（diagram）<MATH_0023>是交换（commutative）的。由《可表示性判别准则》引理<REF_0011>，左侧的竖直箭头是满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）的。考虑<MATH_0024>\n由于<MATH_0025>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，可知基变换（base change）<MATH_0026>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的。此外，<MATH_0027>是满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）的，因为它是<MATH_0028>的基变换（base change）。因此，<MATH_0029>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一个 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），可得<MATH_0030>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，依据为《空间上的下降（Descent）》引理<REF_0012>。\n根据定义，这意味着<MATH_0031>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的（因为竖直箭头<MATH_0032>是光滑（smooth）的，这是由于它是<MATH_0033>的基变换（base change），并且它是满射（surjective）的，这是由于<MATH_0034>只有一个点）。由于<MATH_0035>，可知（3）成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n显然，（3）蕴含（2）。\n若（2）成立，则<MATH_0036>是<MATH_0037>的一个有限型点（finite type point），依据为引理<REF_0013>以及引理<REF_0014>，后者用于说明<MATH_0038>非空（nonempty），即<MATH_0039>的唯一点是<MATH_0040>的一个有限型点（finite type point）。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:dd5763aa515e20e4994719bb5d58d78ad88d3c18b310ade7498169bf400d9360", "unit_id": "tag:06G3:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "本段所涉及的映射；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "态射由代数空间表示的性质；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表示"}, {"context": "可表示性、群胚及覆盖所涉及的空间；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "引用章节《叠的性质》；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "Stacks", "target_term": "叠"}, {"context": "本证明所讨论的点的性质；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"context": "为所给点选取的仿射表示；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"context": "所选仿射概形中的闭点；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "closed point", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"context": "所选态射及其基变换的性质；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"context": "证明中的单个映射；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "由所给构造得到的代数空间中的群胚；词表无批准条目。", "source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "引用章节《代数叠》；词表无批准条目。", 